WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.220
Localfiscal keeps a receipt and transaction ledger on your own machine. In a fresh scratch database, I add fictional client income and an office expense. No bank account or cloud service is involved.

2
00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:21.233
The generated report keeps the currencies separate and represents the amounts as integer minor units. This small example is a local bookkeeping demonstration, not financial or tax advice.

3
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:32.280
Then export the same two transactions as CSV. This records and reports what I supplied; it does not reconcile a bank account. The source and local setup are linked below.
